{
 "name": "r5-zsd-nul-claim-eui",
 "description": "B2 (zsd confirming review): claims whose DevEUI holds a NUL. check-existing-device splices the DevEUI into SQL text, so Node-RED fails before any ChirpStack call; also with a STREGA type, a bad AppKey, a zone and an already claimed EUI.",
